## Implementation Spec: Replace browser prompt()/confirm() with styled modals

### Task 1: Add Rejection Reason Modal HTML to index.html

**File:** `server/templates/index.html`
**Where:** After the existing `feature-modal` div (around line 318), add a new modal overlay.

```html
<!-- Rejection Reason Modal -->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="reject-reason-modal" onclick="closeRejectReasonModal(event)">
    <div class="modal" onclick="event.stopPropagation()" style="max-width:450px">
        <h3 style="color:#f85149">Reject Item</h3>
        <p style="color:#8b949e;margin:0 0 1rem;font-size:0.85rem">Provide a reason for rejection (optional):</p>
        <textarea id="reject-reason-input" placeholder="Rejection reason (optional)" style="width:100%;height:80px;background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #30363d;color:#c9d1d9;padding:0.5rem;border-radius:4px;font-family:inherit;font-size:0.85rem;resize:vertical;margin-bottom:1rem"></textarea>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0.5rem;justify-content:flex-end">
            <button onclick="closeRejectReasonModal()" style="padding:0.5rem 1rem;background:#21262d;color:#c9d1d9;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer">Cancel</button>
            <button onclick="confirmReject()" style="padding:0.5rem 1rem;background:#da3633;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">Reject</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
```

**No dependencies.**

